        "description": "Solstice Health was founded in 2012 as a Direct Primary Care & Wellness medical clinic offering cost-effective and transparent healthcare with excellence, for all patients. After 10 years of shifting the healthcare paradigm in Wisconsin, we have taken transparency and care to a whole new level. Solstice Health is the first and only clinic of its kind in the country with a strong DPC foundation, now offering Direct Surgical Care all under one umbrella. By continually eliminating insurance and middlemen at every level within it’s healthcare ecosystem, we are now offering best-in-class surgeries at rates 70-80% lower than any large hospital system. We include all costs from our board certified surgeons and anesthesiologists, along with facility fees in one low price bill with no hidden costs or surprises. From your first establishing primary care visit, to your pre-operative physical, surgery, and post-operative follow up, we can take care of all of your healthcare needs directly and transparently!",
